          "id": "b06",
          "text": "So the answer is nine hundred.",
          "display": "= 900",
          "cue": "answer"
        },
        {
          "id": "b07",
          "text": "Watch out for these traps. If you add ninety-nine and nine first, you get nine hundred seventy-two. If you leave out the last nine, you get eight hundred ninety-one.",
